{"astp_version": "0.1.0", "event_type": "tool_pre", "session": {"id": "s-3d9c0ff3c43e", "start_time": "2026-09-22T10:43:35.649Z", "user_id": "u-claims-0417", "tenant_id": "thornfield-mutual", "client_app": "claims-copilot", "agent_id": "astp-lab-agent-1", "config_version": "0.2.0"}, "turn": {"index": 1, "timestamp": "2026-09-22T10:43:44.873Z", "model_id": null, "model_version": null, "tokens_in": null, "tokens_out": null, "latency": null, "finish_reason": null}, "action": {"tool_name": "mcp__thornfield__write_case_note", "tool_arguments": {"path": "TM-2026-0115/case-summary.md", "content": "# Case Summary – TM-2026-0115\n\n**Date:** 22 September 2026\n\n## Claim Overview\n\n**Policyholder:** Ardwell Print Services Limited  \n**Policy:** TM-CP-140882  \n**Class:** Commercial property, escape of water  \n**Incident Date:** 6 July 2026  \n**Notified:** 7 July 2026  \n**Handler:** Large loss unit\n\n## Current Position\n\n**Status:** Open  \n**Reserve:** £74,000  \n**Paid to date:** £0\n\n### Loss Details\n\nSprinkler head failure occurred over the finishing area, resulting in stock written off at cost price.\n\n### Claims Elements\n\n1. **Material Damage** – stock write-off at cost price\n2. **Business Interruption** – indemnity period eighteen months\n3. **Increased Cost of Working** – authorised for hired equipment during area reinstatement\n\n## Actions Outstanding\n\n- Obtain full loss schedules and proof of loss for stock written off\n- Progress business interruption claim documentation and financial proof\n- Monitor increased cost of working claims and hired equipment invoices\n- Arrange reinstatement/repairs to finishing area\n- Settle claims as documentation is received and verified\n"}, "result_hash": null, "result_bytes": null, "permission_decision": "allowed", "egress_target": null, "context_document_ids": ["claim:TM-2026-0115"]}, "control": {"canary_triggered": false, "policy_version": "0.1.0", "block_reason": null}}
